      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُدَاعٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>Headache:</i> (S, O, Msb, K:) Er-Rághib
says that it is <i>like a splitting in the head by reason
of pain;</i> and is a metaphorical term. (TA.)

